{"orgCode":"6120","name":"California State Library","agencyCode":"6010","agencyName":"K thru 12 Education","description":"The California State Library, established in 1850, collects, preserves, generates, and disseminates information, including materials that represent the stories of Californians in an equal, diverse, and inclusive manner. The Library administers programs funded by state and federal funds to support local public libraries and statewide library programs. The State Librarian is appointed by the Governor.\n\nThe California Library Services Board (the state board) consists of 13 members; 9 members are appointed by the Governor, 2 members are appointed by the Senate Rules Committee, and 2 members are appointed by the Speaker of the Assembly. Members serve four-year terms. The state board determines policy for and authorizes allocation of funds for the California Library Services Act. The state board also functions as the State Advisory Council on Libraries for the federal Library Services and Technology Act. The State Librarian serves as chief executive officer of the state board.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":118371,"cy":79180,"by":88413},"positions":{"py":165,"cy":172.9,"by":172.9},"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":6,"cy":300,"by":300},"nongovernmental":{"py":2492,"cy":2492,"by":2057}}},"programs":{"id":"exp/6010/6120","kind":"department","name":"California State Library","code":"6120","amounts":{"py":118371,"cy":79180,"by":88413},"positions":{"py":165,"cy":172.9,"by":172.9},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":102167,"cy":59983,"by":69212},"special":{"py":747,"cy":751,"by":751},"federal":{"py":15457,"cy":18446,"by":18450}},"children":[{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5310","kind":"program","name":"State Library Services","code":"5310","amounts":{"py":30251,"cy":28781,"by":38187},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":26479,"cy":23415,"by":32819},"special":{"py":195,"cy":199,"by":199},"federal":{"py":3577,"cy":5167,"by":5169}},"positions":{"py":126.3,"cy":133.1,"by":133.1},"description":"5310 - STATE LIBRARY SERVICES\n\nThe State Library Services (SLS) program serves as the central reference and research library for the Governor, the Legislature, and state government officials and staff. SLS also provides library services to the public by making available collections and services in its branch libraries, special collections, and online. SLS gathers, catalogs, digitizes, preserves and protects information and materials. SLS answers reference and informational questions for local libraries and coordinates the distribution of state and federal publications to libraries.\n\nThe Braille and Talking Book Library, a regional library designated by the Library of Congress National Library Service for the Blind and Print Disabled, provides Braille and recorded books (digital cartridges and downloadable files) and special playback and other equipment to blind and print-disabled residents of Northern California who are unable to use standard print materials.\n\nThe Bernard E. Witkin State Law Library contains primary and secondary sources in American law, federal and state appellate court opinions, session laws, codes and statutes, federal agency decisions, and attorney general opinions of the U.S. and 55 jurisdictions, with a particular focus in regulatory and legislative history.\n\nThe California Research Bureau (CRB) provides nonpartisan and confidential public policy research, analysis, and specialized library services on major state issues for the Legislature, the Governor's Office, and other constitutional officers.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":27975,"cy":31573,"by":40544},"Local Assistance":{"py":4774,"cy":0,"by":0}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5310/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":26479,"cy":23415,"by":32819},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":26479,"cy":23415,"by":32819}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":21705,"cy":23415,"by":32819},"Local Assistance":{"py":4774,"cy":0,"by":0}}}},{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5310/f0020","kind":"fund","name":"California State Law Library Special Account","code":"0020","amounts":{"py":195,"cy":199,"by":199},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":195,"cy":199,"by":199}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":195,"cy":199,"by":199}}}},{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5310/f0890","kind":"fund","name":"Federal Trust Fund","code":"0890","amounts":{"py":3577,"cy":5167,"by":5169},"byFundType":{"federal":{"py":3577,"cy":5167,"by":5169}},"extra":{"fundType":"federal","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3577,"cy":5167,"by":5169}}}}],"excludedChildren":[{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5310/f0995","kind":"fund","name":"Reimbursements","code":"0995","amounts":{"py":6,"cy":300,"by":300},"byFundType":{"reimbursement":{"py":6,"cy":300,"by":300}},"extra":{"fundType":"reimbursement","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":6,"cy":300,"by":300}}}},{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5310/f9740","kind":"fund","name":"Central Service Cost Recovery Fund","code":"9740","amounts":{"py":2492,"cy":2492,"by":2057},"byFundType":{"nongovernmental":{"py":2492,"cy":2492,"by":2057}},"extra":{"fundType":"nongovernmental","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":2492,"cy":2492,"by":2057}}}}],"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":6,"cy":300,"by":300},"nongovernmental":{"py":2492,"cy":2492,"by":2057}}},{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5312","kind":"program","name":"Library Development Services","code":"5312","amounts":{"py":84619,"cy":46512,"by":46389},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":72478,"cy":32972,"by":32847},"special":{"py":552,"cy":552,"by":552},"federal":{"py":11589,"cy":12988,"by":12990}},"positions":{"py":26.7,"cy":28,"by":28},"description":"5312 - LIBRARY DEVELOPMENT SERVICES\n\nThe Library Development Services (LDS) program distributes state and federal funds to local libraries and provides technical assistance to help local libraries extend and improve services to residents. LDS also administers the following programs:\n\n• The California Library Services Act, which promotes resource sharing among public libraries in the state.\n\n• The California Library Literacy and English Acquisition Services Program, which supports community-centered literacy assistance to English-speaking adults.\n\n• The federal Library Services and Technology Act, which provides grants to libraries of all types on a competitive basis for developing new and innovative library services, providing technology assistance, engaging in networking and resource sharing, and providing library services to underserved populations.\n\n• Statewide Broadband Services, which helps public libraries connect to a high-speed internet network.\n\n• The Lunch at the Library Program, which supports public library jurisdictions in providing children and teens with meals, summer reading programs, and other activities that support learning, health, and wellness.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":5327,"cy":5461,"by":5409},"Local Assistance":{"py":79292,"cy":41051,"by":40980}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5312/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":72478,"cy":32972,"by":32847},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":72478,"cy":32972,"by":32847}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":2355,"cy":2343,"by":2289},"Local Assistance":{"py":70123,"cy":30629,"by":30558}}}},{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5312/f0890","kind":"fund","name":"Federal Trust Fund","code":"0890","amounts":{"py":11589,"cy":12988,"by":12990},"byFundType":{"federal":{"py":11589,"cy":12988,"by":12990}},"extra":{"fundType":"federal","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":2972,"cy":3118,"by":3120},"Local Assistance":{"py":8617,"cy":9870,"by":9870}}}},{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5312/f0483","kind":"fund","name":"Deaf and Disabled Telecommunications Program Administrative Committee Fund","code":"0483","amounts":{"py":552,"cy":552,"by":552},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":552,"cy":552,"by":552}},"extra":{"fundType":"special","byAppropriationType":{"Local Assistance":{"py":552,"cy":552,"by":552}}}}]},{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5314","kind":"program","name":"Information Technology Services","code":"5314","amounts":{"py":3501,"cy":3887,"by":3837},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":3210,"cy":3596,"by":3546},"federal":{"py":291,"cy":291,"by":291}},"positions":{"py":12,"cy":11.8,"by":11.8},"description":"5314 - INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY SERVICES\n\nThe Information Technology Services program supports technology operations and infrastructure, including the integrated bibliographic library system, network infrastructure, data communications, and computer systems and applications.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3501,"cy":3887,"by":3837}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5314/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":3210,"cy":3596,"by":3546},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":3210,"cy":3596,"by":3546}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3210,"cy":3596,"by":3546}}}},{"id":"exp/6010/6120/5314/f0890","kind":"fund","name":"Federal Trust Fund","code":"0890","amounts":{"py":291,"cy":291,"by":291},"byFundType":{"federal":{"py":291,"cy":291,"by":291}},"extra":{"fundType":"federal","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":291,"cy":291,"by":291}}}}]}],"sources":[{"label":"ebudget.ca.gov API: orgProgram/6120","url":"https://ebudget.ca.gov/api/budget/e/2026-27/orgProgram/6120"},{"label":"Detailed Expenditures by Program (PDF)","url":"https://ebudget.ca.gov/2026-27/pdf/Enacted/GovernorsBudget/6000/6120.pdf"}],"extra":{"legalCitations":"Education Code Sections 12130, 13000, 13015, 13020, 13025, 13030, 13040 to 13042, 19300 to 19303, 19306 to 19307, 19320 to 19328, 19330 to 19336, 19950 to 19952, 19955 to 19967, 19970 to 19981, and 19985 to 20011.\nChapter 492, Statutes of 1915.\nChapter 880, Statutes of 1978.\n\nPROGRAM AUTHORITY\n\n5310-State Library Services:\nEducation Code Sections 19320, 19323 to 19325.1, and 19328.\nGovernment Code Sections 14900 to 14912 and 68926.3.\n\n5312-Library Development Services:\nEducation Code Sections 18010 to 18013, 18015, 18020 to 18026, 18030 to 18032, 18700 to 18703, 18767, and 18880 to 18881, 18883.\n\n5314-Information Technology Services:\nEducation Code Section 19320."},"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":6,"cy":300,"by":300},"nongovernmental":{"py":2492,"cy":2492,"by":2057}}},"funding":{"id":"exp/6010/6120/funding","kind":"root","name":"California State Library: Funding by fund and appropriation","amounts":{"py":118371,"cy":79180,"by":88413},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":102167,"cy":59983,"by":69212},"special":{"py":747,"cy":751,"by":751},"federal":{"py":15457,"cy":18446,"by":18450}},"children":[{"id":"exp/6010/6120/funding/general","kind":"fundType","name":"General Fund","code":"general","amounts":{"py":102167,"cy":59983,"by":69212},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":102167,"cy":59983,"by":69212}},"children":[{"id":"exp/6010/6120/fund/0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":102167,"cy":59983,"by":69212},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":102167,"cy":59983,"by":69212}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","fundClass":"G","support":{"py":102167,"cy":59983,"by":69212},"capitalOutlay":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0}},"children":[{"id":"exp/6010/6120/fund/0001/6120-011-0001","kind":"item","name":"011 Budget Act appropriation","amounts":{"py":26866,"cy":29354,"by":29985},"extra":{"lineType":"item","appropriationType":"State Operations","enacted":{"py":26866,"cy":33105,"by":29985},"adjustments":[{"label":"Adjustment for Budget Act Alignment","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":-3890,"by":0}},{"label":"Adjustment for Budget Act Alignment - Technical Adjustment","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":-300,"by":0}},{"label":"Allocation for Employee Compensation","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":-15,"by":0}},{"label":"Allocation for Other Post-Employment Benefits